  The path data is the export's own, unmodified. A **stroked** glyph like every
  other icon on this screen - 1.8 wide with round caps and joins - so the colour is
  a stroke rather than a fill, and it comes from a token so the glyph inverts with
  the theme instead of carrying the light value the SVG was exported with.
-->
